note as BIZ_diagram_41_scheduling
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  The full booking (agenda) layer on top of the clinical appointment record. Models
  bookable resources (practitioners, rooms, equipment), schedule templates and rules
  that generate slots, availability exceptions, concurrency-safe slot holds (the
  distributed reservation lock for CU-10), confirmed bookings, reschedules,
  cancellations with policy-driven fees, waitlists and reminders. The canonical
  clinical appointment stays in module 08/18; this module owns the reservation
  lifecycle and anti-double-booking guarantees.
end note

